  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;rstudie friv&#xe5;rd LIT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Study probation LIT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">F&#xf6;r att bl.a. f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;ka minska ner f&#xe4;ngelsepopulationen har Litauen givit h&#xf6;g prioritet att utverka alternativa straffmetoder. F&#xf6;r att st&#xf6;dja Litauen i detta reformarbete kommer Kriminalv&#xe5;rdsstyrelsen tillsammans med Kanadas f&#xe4;ngelseadministration genomf&#xf6;ra en f&#xf6;rstudie inom friv&#xe5;rd.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Government of Lithuania has given high priority to implement probation and parole services as an alternative to prison. In order tosupport this has the Swedish and Canadian Prison Department agreed to undertake a feasibility study aiming to provide specific  legaslative provision for a service.</narrative>
  </description>
